ever-expanding database of 1.1M+ under-the-radar markets, products, and investment opportunities.</p></div></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="whats_included_card"><img src="../../static/images/whats-included/trend-search.webp" alt="trend-search.png"/><div class="whats_included_content"><h3>Trend Analysis</h3><p>Get deep-dive data on any trend, including growth, search metrics and channel-level insights.</p></div></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="whats_included_card"><img src="../../static/images/whats-included/trend-tracking.webp" alt="trend-tracking.png"/><div class="whats_included_content"><h3>Trend Tracking</h3><p>Be the first to know when a new trend is about to take off.</p></div></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="whats_included_card"><img src="../../static/images/whats-included/meta-trends.webp" alt="meta-trends.png"/><div class="whats_included_content"><h3>Meta Trends</h3><p>See high-impact trends in tech, DTC, marketing, SaaS, healthcare, fitness, fashion and more.</p></div></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="whats_included_card"><img src="../../static/images/whats-included/Trend-Forecasting.webp" alt="Trend-Forecasting.png"/><div class="whats_included_content"><h3>Trend Forecasting</h3><p>See what next year&#x27;s trend will look like using cutting edge machine learning trained on millions of data points.</p></div></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="whats_included_card"><img src="../../static/images/whats-included/trending-product.webp" alt="trending-product.png"/><div class="whats_included_content"><h3>Trending Products</h3><p>See thousands of trending products well before they go mainstream.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="testomonial_section"><div class="container"><div class="col-12"><div class="testomonial_section_content"><p>“Exploding Topics Pro gives us a huge competitive advantage. We use it to spot non-obvious opportunities for products, features, investments and more.”</p><div class="testomonial_user "><div class="testomonial_user_img "> <img src="../static/images/sales/eric-clickflow.png" class="rounded-circle"/></div> <div><h5>Eric Siu</h5><p>Founder of ClickFlow</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="find_trend_sec_v2 v2-spacing-top v2-spacing-bottom"><div class="container"><div class="find_trend_disc text-center"><h3>How We Find Trends</h3><p>We track every topic on the internet to identify under-the-radar trends before they go mainstream.</p></div><div class="row"><div class="how-we-find-trends-v2-container"><img src="../static/images/find-trend/how-we-find-trends-v2.png"/></div><div class="mobile-how-we-find-trends-v2-container"><div class="col-md-4 col2"><img src="../static/images/find-trend/social-media-logos.png"/></div><div class="col-md-4 col2"><img style="margin-top:20px" src="../static/images/find-trend/selected-topics2.png"/></div></div></div><div class="row find_trend_card"><div class="col-md-4"><div class="find_trend_card_con"><h5><span>1</span> Analyze</h5><p>We analyze consumer behavior signals across dozens of platforms.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="find_trend_card_con"><h5><span>2</span> Identify</h5><p>Our trend-spotting algorithm identifies trends.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="find_trend_card_con"><h5><span>3</span> Curate</h5><p>We manually analyze the data, confirm and curate trends.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="testomonial_section"><div class="container"><div class="col-12"><div class="testomonial_section_content"><p>“Getting data first can make or break a business. Exploding Topics Pro helps you see what&#x27;s coming next before anybody else. That way, you know where to best invest your time and resources.”</p><div class="testomonial_user "><div class="testomonial_user_img "> <img src="../static/images/sales/heini-vivino.png" class="rounded-circle"/></div> <div><h5>Heini Zachariassen</h5><p>Founder and CEO of Vivino</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="small_smaple_sec v2-spacing-top v2-spacing-bottom"><div class="container"><div class="small_smaple_disc"><h2>Small Sample of Trends That We Found Super Early</h2></div><div class="row small_smaple_row1"><div class="mobile-spacer"></div><div class="col-md-3 col-6"><img class="small_smaple_image" src="../../static/images/sales/mushroom-coffee.png" alt="mushroom-coffee.png"/></div><div class="col-md-3 col-6"><img class="small_smaple_image" src="../../static/images/sales/Ai-image-enhancer.png" alt="Ai-image-enhancer.png"/></div><div class="col-md-3 col-6"><img class="small_smaple_image" src="../../static/images/small-smaple/veed-io.png" alt="veed-io.png"/></div><div class="col-md-3 col-6"><img class="small_smaple_image" src="../../static/images/sales/pimple-patches.png" alt="pimple-patches.png"/></div><div class="mobile-spacer"></div></div><div class="row small_smaple_row2"><div class="mobile-spacer"></div><div class="col-md-3 col-6"><img class="small_smaple_image" src="../../static/images/sales/Flutterflow.png" alt="Flutterflow.png"/></div><div class="col-md-3 col-6"><img class="small_smaple_image" src="../../static/images/sales/Remote-Jobs.png" alt="Remote-Jobs"/></div><div class="col-md-3 col-6"><img class="small_smaple_image" src="../../static/images/small-smaple/mewing.png" alt="mewing.png"/></div><div class="col-md-3 col-6"><img class="small_smaple_image" src="../../static/images/small-smaple/frontend-mentor.png" alt="Frontend-Mentor.png"/></div><div class="mobile-spacer"></div></div></div></section><section class="testomonial_section"><div class="container"><div class="col-12"><div class="testomonial_section_content"><p>“As a VC, I try to see around corners. Which can be extremely challenging. Exploding Topics Pro helps me identify trends that no one else is highlighting. Which is extremely valuable to me as an investor.”</p><div class="testomonial_user "><div class="testomonial_user_img "> <img src="../sta